@startuml
title Green Rides State Transition Diagram

[*] --> JourneyDetails : User Login & Destination Selection

state "Journey Details" as JourneyDetails
state "Driving Mode/Options" as DrivingModeOptions
state "Eating Options" as EatingOptions
state "Accident Reporting" as AccidentReporting
state "Notifications" as Notifications
state "Feedback Submission" as FeedbackSubmission

JourneyDetails --> DrivingModeOptions : Activate Driving Mode / Choose Other Options
JourneyDetails --> EatingOptions : User is Hungry
JourneyDetails --> AccidentReporting : Event of an Accident
JourneyDetails --> Notifications : During Driving or Accident

DrivingModeOptions --> Notifications : Send Notifications
EatingOptions --> Notifications : Send Notifications
AccidentReporting --> Notifications : Send Notifications
Notifications --> JourneyDetails : Continue Journey / Acknowledge Notification

DrivingModeOptions --> FeedbackSubmission : Journey Completion

FeedbackSubmission --> [*]

@enduml
